# Documentation only: the distributed application does not read .env files.
# Never place passwords, activation codes, private keys or tokens in this file,
# Java arguments, source code or resources. There are no client AWS credentials.
# source_version is read from tb_config_sistema (VERSAOBANCODADOS).
# Installation and run IDs are resolved internally from the signed API response.
# Configure non-secret settings in src/main/resources/application.properties before building.
# Enter database credentials and the first-use activation code interactively in Swing.
# Never distribute a populated token store.
